> What can I do to fix my alignment?

Record what monster was inadeqate.  Don't bother with that type
of monster or any weaker one.  Next sac, focus on a stronger
type of monster.  In the end you might end up with a table like
the spoiler link posted by rpresser.  Note that monsters you
can't pick up are mean enough - giants, dragons, mumak and
so on can be walked to the altar, killed at the altar, and saced
to reduce anger.  Knowing the exact list is more effective than
waiting for those specific monster tyeps.


